{"Double interpolation duplicates ad-hoc filters in shard splitting - runShardSplitQuery calls applyTemplateVariables on all targets, then passes them to splitQueriesByStreamShard which delegates to runSplitQuery, which also calls applyTemplateVariables, causing ad-hoc filters to be applied twice producing incorrect query expressions with duplicate filter clauses": 0.8162240386009216, "Test mocks mutate input instead of returning a copy - applyTemplateVariables mocks directly mutate the input query.expr and return the same object, but the real implementation returns a new object without mutating input, meaning tests don't accurately model real behavior and could mask bugs where code relies on original targets being unmodified after interpolation": 0.2005373239517212}